    "campaign": {
      "revision": "campaign-r2-hybrid-full-v1-parent-review-pending",
      "instructions": "Print only supplied Simplified Chinese artwork text. Professional operational Chinese: clear reconciliation objects and responsible team, concise question and practical next step. Use supplied mainland terminology, not word-for-word Vietnamese syntax. No assumptions about national personality, certification or guaranteed results. Keep original scene and narrative order. Preserve Simplified Chinese glyphs and exact supplied punctuation. Never mix scripts or use pseudo-Chinese. Use ASCII parentheses for approved acronym definitions to remain compatible with the frozen gate; do not normalize other punctuation. Review Chinese punctuation at line starts/ends and mixed Latin terms at 333px; reduce scene area before shrinking type. B13v5 bright white/blue photographic campaign family. Reference wording is not approved copy. Official supplied logo once; no extra DIGIWIN header. Exact category/sequence near logo. Chinese body MUST wrap naturally into2-3 large readable lines at333CSSpx; never squeeze a long body onto one small line. Entire Taiwan source must wrap into2-3 full-width large lines, each at least body-sized. Shrink scene before text. Body comfortably readable at333CSSpx. Source normal full-width main paragraph on white, at least body-sized. All paper blank; no bars/rules/charts/ticks/data glyphs/UI/customer geography/seal/badge. Only approved artwork words. Partner handoff questions are not forecast accuracy or automatic replanning claims. Reduce scene before type. CRITICAL BOUNDED C2: Keep the body exactly as current two lines, do NOT enlarge it further. All source characters MUST be LARGER than the body characters. Body approximately 54-58px native. Complete source approximately 68-72px native, visually obviously larger. Reflow source into three lines: Digiwin 台湾半导体方案资料： / ERP 经营管理与 / MES(制造执行系统) 生产制造。 Preserve every character including Digiwin, ERP, MES definition. Place source in a LARGE WHITE PANEL occupying the lower 30 percent. Shrink center scene to a small band occupying at most 15 percent of the card height. Shrink headline slightly if needed; never shrink body or source. Preserve exact headline 为交接讨论建立共同依据。, body 把批次范围、记录来源与确认责任放进同一次协调讨论。, source text, CTA 探讨委外生产交接问题, ERP · 芯片运营 and 5/6. Keep Digiwin logo. Two blank pale blue tiles and sealed chip carrier are illustrative only. No report glyphs or extra wording. Exact approved text is authoritative; whitespace and line breaks may change. Native body and full source must both remain readable at feed333."
    }
